      "known_miss_note": "Measured 2026-07-12: scores 45/medium. Chains fire correctly (pii-exfil, bulk-external, pii-bulk) but the score formula under-weights read+exfil capability: PII reads sit on the 0.15x read-only floor and touches_pii weighs 8, so an agent shaped like the best-known exfil incident cannot reach critical. THE top measured formula gap - do not remove this flag by relabeling; fix the formula."
